# 行尾红线：启动脚本曾被 LF 行尾截断导致路径拼接错误，cmd/bat 必须锁定 CRLF
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

* text=auto

# 二进制资产
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.nupkg binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.jar binary
*.apk binary
*.lib binary
*.bin binary
